<view class="page"><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{uncertain}}">上次操作结果未确认，请返回后查询列表、重新打开详情核对。</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}">正在处理…</view><block wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="title">编辑表定义</view><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><text>{{item.label}}</text><input value="{{detail.table[item.key]}}" disabled="{{item.key === 'tableName'}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="tableInput" /></view><view>子表一对多 <switch checked="{{detail.table.subJoinMany}}" bindchange="subToggle"/></view><view wx:for="{{detail.columns}}" wx:for-item="column" wx:for-index="ci" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="title">{{column.columnName}}（{{column.dataType}}）</view><view wx:for="{{colFields}}" wx:for-item="field" wx:key="key"><text>{{field.label}}</text><input value="{{column[field.key]}}" data-key="{{field.key}}" data-index="{{ci}}" bindinput="columnInput"/></view><view wx:for="{{['createOperation','updateOperation','listOperation','listOperationResult']}}" wx:for-item="flag" wx:key="*this">{{flag}} <switch checked="{{column[flag]}}" data-index="{{ci}}" data-key="{{flag}}" bindchange="columnToggle"/></view></view><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">保存生成配置</button><button bindtap="close">返回</button></block><block wx:elif="{{preview.length}}"><view class="title">代码预览</view><view wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="filePath" class="card"><view>{{item.filePath}}</view><text selectable>{{item.code}}</text></view><button bindtap="close">返回</button></block><block wx:else><view class="title">代码生成</view><view>配置生成模板并导出源码；不会在服务器执行生成的代码。</view><input placeholder="表名称" value="{{query}}" bindinput="queryInput"/><button bindtap="search">查询</button><view class="card"><view>导入：输入数据源编号并读取表</view><view wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="id">{{item.id}}：{{item.name}}</view><input type="number" placeholder="数据源编号" value="{{sourceId}}" bindinput="sourceInput"/><button bindtap="browse">读取数据库表</button><checkbox-group bindchange="select"><label wx:for="{{tables}}" wx:key="name"><checkbox value="{{item.name}}"/>{{item.name}} {{item.comment}}</label></checkbox-group><button wx:if="{{tables.length}}" bindtap="importTables">导入选中表</button></view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view>{{item.tableName}} · {{item.tableComment}}</view><view>{{item.className}}</view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open" disabled="{{busy}}">编辑</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="preview" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy}}">预览</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="download" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy}}">下载源码</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="sync-from-db" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">同步表结构</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-action="delete" bindtap="action" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}">删除定义</button></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length && !busy && !error}}">暂无记录</view><button size="mini" bindtap="prev">上一页</button> 第 {{pageNo}} 页，共 {{total}} 条 <button size="mini" bindtap="next">下一页</button></block></view>
